%% Updated 2026-07-14 (Audit Fix)
mindmap
  root((🌟 SUAR Platform
   Problems & Solutions))

    ⚡ Core Problems
      ❌ Complex cross-org task management
        Multiple projects, multiple roles
        Lack of skill matching tools
      ❌ Hard to find suitable contributors
        No centralized marketplace
        Lack of reliable rating system
      ❌ Non-transparent personnel evaluation
        1-way review, lacking peer review
        Unable to detect fraud
      ❌ Lack of trust verification
        No distinction between internal vs external
        No verification mechanism

    💡 Solutions — Suar Platform
      📊 Task Management
        CRUD tasks with versioning
         ⚠️ version only created on Update (not Create/Status change)
        Kanban board, filter, priority
        DB-driven workflow (task_statuses + task_workflow_transitions)
         ⚠️ Legacy state machine deprecated
        Soft delete + audit trail
      🛒 Public Task Marketplace
        Task visibility
         internal / external / all
         ⚠️ Ranking/Match score implemented in action/business docs
        Task application process
         proposal → review → assign
        Application sources
         public_listing / invitation / referral
         ⚠️ invitation/referral not implemented yet
      ⭐ 360° Review System
        Trust Tier weighted scoring
         Community 0.5 / Org 0.8 / Partner 1.0
        Credibility formula (ratio-based)
         base 50 plus confirmed ratio minus disputed ratio
        6 fraud patterns declared in SQL
         ✅ detect_anomaly_command checks bulk_same_level, new_account_high, mutual_high
         ⚠️ ip_collusion documented as placeholder; no current check found for sudden_spike or frequency_anomaly
        Confirm / Dispute mechanism
        Reverse review for reviewers
        Spider chart & trust score
         review listeners trigger reviewed-skill recalculation
         and profile aggregate refresh after review events
      🔐 3-Tier Permission System
        System level
         superadmin > system_admin > registered_user
        Organization level
         org_owner > org_admin > org_member
        Project level
         project_owner > project_manager > member > viewer
      💬 Legacy messaging schema
        No active product route/controller
        No realtime transport
        Keep as historical data model only
